"Nifty may have lost its spark since last Diwali, but 25 penny stocks made investors up to 540% richer",https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nifty-may-have-lost-its-spark-since-last-diwali-but-25-penny-stocks-made-investors-up-to-540-richer/articleshow/124567551.cms,"Wed, 15 Oct 2025 10:02:56 +0530","While major Indian stock indices saw modest gains, a surprising rally occurred in penny stocks. Over the past year, at least 25 low-priced stocks delivered returns of up to 540%, significantly outperforming larger counterparts. These microcap gains, often in sectors like infrastructure and finance, highlight a vibrant, albeit speculative, segment of the market."
Ola Electric shares in focus on reports of likely expansion plans in energy segment,https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/ola-electric-shares-in-focus-on-reports-of-likely-expansion-plans-in-energy-segment/articleshow/124567524.cms,"Wed, 15 Oct 2025 10:00:19 +0530","Ola Electric is poised to enter the energy sector with a new product launch on October 17, 2025, expanding beyond its EV core. Chairman Bhavish Aggarwal hinted at a strategic shift towards intelligent, portable, and personal power solutions. Industry speculation points towards a potential entry into Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS), leveraging existing technology and manufacturing capacity."
US labour market &amp; Fed policy: Balancing jobs and inflation,https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/us-labour-market-fed-policy-balancing-jobs-and-inflation/slideshow/124567520.cms,"Wed, 15 Oct 2025 09:52:13 +0530","The U.S. labour market remains weak yet stable as the Fed adopts a cautious, data-driven approach to balance inflation control and employment, with gradual rate cuts expected amid mixed economic signals."
Cyient DLM shares in focus after Q2 profit more than doubles despite revenue decline,https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/cyient-dlm-shares-in-focus-after-q2-profit-more-than-doubles-despite-revenue-decline/articleshow/124567300.cms,"Wed, 15 Oct 2025 09:48:26 +0530","Cyient DLM reported a 113.3% YoY jump in Q2 FY26 net profit to Rs 32 crore, despite a 20.3% decline in revenue to Rs 310.6 crore due to the completion of a large defence order. EBITDA margin improved to 10%, aided by supply chain efficiencies and a favourable business mix. Order intake rose to Rs 497.7 crore, expanding the backlog."
Nifty glitters before Diwali; post-Diwali fizzle may be just a market myth,https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nifty-glitters-before-diwali-post-diwali-fizzle-may-be-just-a-market-myth/articleshow/124567208.cms,"Wed, 15 Oct 2025 09:42:49 +0530","Nifty often shines before Diwali, but data shows the post-Diwali slump is largely a myth. While pre-Diwali optimism is evident, the market has shown positive returns in the week after the festival in recent years. Factors like steady SIP inflows and improving earnings provide structural support."
"Kolte-Patil shares in focus as Q2 sales rise 9% QoQ to Rs 670 crore, acquires land for Rs 1,400 crore",https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/kolte-patil-shares-in-focus-as-q2-sales-rise-9-qoq-to-rs-670-crore-acquires-land-for-rs-1400-crore/articleshow/124567160.cms,"Wed, 15 Oct 2025 09:37:55 +0530","Kolte-Patil shares: The company reported Q2FY26 sales of ₹670 crore, up 9% sequentially but down 13% year-on-year, supported by steady demand across projects. Sales volume grew 2% QoQ to 0.86 million sq. ft., with its flagship township, Life Republic, contributing 0.51 million sq. ft."
